{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-09/1063201/block/singleImage/3264172/df/01M3DS5MY8EMRWZXKPBNB9111S.jpg?updatedAt=1794380214\"/><figcaption>威爾斯親王醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>西貢發生工業意外。 今日（11日）中午11時49分，西貢康定路一個貨倉一名男工遭一綑約重300公斤的紙卷砸傷，其同事發現後連忙報警求助。警方及救援人員接報後到場，發現一名男子腳部受傷，他清醒由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。警方正在調查事件。據報，傷者搬貨期間遭該綑紙卷壓傷腳。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T07:45:17.997552+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:56:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:22.114416+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:41.258521+00:00","content_hash":"ebdfbcfde9b060fdbc877a776917ca64b7e3367fe3dddfff6dfb7d267244bc42","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}